  "canonical_role": "Wisdom links instruction, prayer, reflection on suffering, and teaching about faithful life. The Gospels present Jesus using wisdom-shaped teaching, Paul contrasts God’s wisdom with worldly standards, and James describes wisdom through conduct. These New Testament passages extend the theme while retaining the concrete practices highlighted in Israel’s wisdom texts.",
